From 41731b81392032ca3f26037a25c45d07c6265d16 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AndrewDany <andrewsdanyo93@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 15:20:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix returns not restocking when inventory_item_id is
 unresolved

- ReturnForm: replace free-text SKU input with an inventory item
  picker (matching SalesOrderForm/PurchaseOrderForm), so
  inventory_item_id is always set on submit instead of null.
- returnSchema: require inventory_item_id before a return can be
  submitted.
- process_return(): resolve inventory_item_id from sku server-side
  if still null, and raise instead of silently completing without
  updating stock.
- Add backfill-missed-return-restocks.sql to repair returns already
  stuck completed without their stock increase applied (e.g.
  LIG-BLU-001).
